            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "review_1_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-jelly-rev-chiara.webp",
            "review_1_name": "Chiara L.",
            "review_1_rating": "5",
            "review_1_title": "5 stars · Nude",
            "review_1_text": "So guys, I was TIRED of buying bras every 3 months because the underwire always broke. With this I’ve been using it for almost a month, washed it like 6 times and it’s still perfect. Zero deformations, zero broken underwire.\n\nOh and the wide straps are a bomb, finally no marks on shoulders when I take it off!\n\nOnly thing: the first time I got nude color thinking it was light, but it’s really NUDE (like beige). But I’m rebuying anyway.",
            "review_2_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-jelly-rev-francesca.webp",
            "review_2_name": "Francesca D.",
            "review_2_rating": "5",
            "review_2_title": "5 stars · 3 colors",
            "review_2_text": "Story time: I went out with this + short skirt, and my boyfriend goes “how do you have such nice boobs?”\n\nGuys. HE DIDN’T KNOW I was wearing a new bra.\n\nThis is proof it works. The gel gives you natural shape, but NO ONE understands there’s something underneath.\n\nI use it 3 times a week at least. Got 3 colors. Cellulite doesn’t show, breasts look perfect.",
            "review_3_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-jelly-rev-laura.webp",
            "review_3_name": "Laura R.",
            "review_3_rating": "5",
            "review_3_title": "5 stars · Size M",
            "review_3_text": "After breastfeeding I had breasts I really didn’t like. I tried push-up bras with underwires but they were so uncomfortable all day.\n\nThis is like 2 in 1: it supports like a push-up but is comfortable like a sports bra. No one notices it has “gel” inside, looks completely normal.\n\nI got size M (I’m 3rd cup) and it fits perfectly.",
            "review_4_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-jelly-rev-sophie.jpg",
            "review_4_name": "Sophie M.",
            "review_4_rating": "5",
            "review_4_title": "5 stars · 3 colors",
            "review_4_text": "Ok guys I have to be honest. I bought it only because I was tired of underwires hurting me all day. I didn’t expect it to make my boobs look so good too lol 😂\n\nThat jelly technology really makes a difference, it supports but doesn’t hurt. And the back part is WIDE so zero rolls coming out like with my old bras.\n\nOnly “problem”: now I don’t want to wear regular bras anymore haha. Already got 3 different colors.",
            "review_5_photo": "shopify://shop_images/ls-jelly-rev-alessia.jpg",
            "review_5_name": "Alessia T.",
            "review_5_rating": "5",
            "review_5_title": "5 stars · Smooth back",
            "review_5_text": "This is what stressed me most about regular bras… every time I raised my arms I was afraid people would see back rolls 💀\n\nWith this ZERO problems. I tested it like in every possible way (yes, I even took mirror photos with a tight shirt lol) and you see NOTHING.\n\nAnd girls, it’s super comfortable. Like I even use it to sleep (yes, I know you shouldn’t but it’s so comfortable I forget I’m wearing it)."
          },
