        "question_pT9n9i": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's special about this bra?",
            "answer": "<p>It looks like a regular bra, but it’s completely different.</p><p>It has three innovations:</p><ul><li><strong>Jelly-Sculpt™ Technology</strong>: No painful underwire. The gel adapts to your breasts and supports them naturally.</li><li><strong>Wide straps (4cm)</strong>: Don’t mark shoulders and hide back rolls. Your back will be smooth.</li><li><strong>Seamless antibacterial fabric</strong>: Invisible under everything. Even white shirt. Even fitted top. And doesn’t smell even if you wear it all day.</li></ul><p>It’s almost impossible to break. Not like regular bras where the underwire breaks after 3 months.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_UGzjUG": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it tear easily?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>NO! It’s indestructible.</strong></p><p>You can:</p><ul><li>Pull it hard when putting it on</li><li>Wash it in machine 200+ times</li><li>Use it every day</li><li>Move freely</li></ul><p>And it WON’T break.</p><p>We also have <strong>LIFETIME GUARANTEE</strong>: if it breaks, we replace it for free. Forever.</p><p>Stop wasting $30 every 3 months on bras where the underwire breaks!</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_rGxXCE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it really support or is it just comfortable?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>YES! It supports A LOT.</strong></p><p>Jelly-Sculpt™ gel gives you the same support as an underwire bra, but without pain.</p><p>You can use it for:</p><ul><li>Work all day</li><li>Gym (supports during sports)</li><li>Evening outings</li><li>Even sleeping (so comfortable)</li></ul><p>A customer wrote: “I can’t believe it can be so comfortable AND support so well!”</p><p>Another customer: “I’ve taken naps in this thing, which is crazy because I have sensory issues”</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_PB6MiJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it show under clothes?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>NO! It’s completely invisible.</strong></p><p>The white shirt test: seamless fabric (no seams) that disappears under:</p><ul><li>White shirts</li><li>Fitted tops</li><li>Stretch dresses</li><li>Transparent blouses</li></ul><p>Also hides back rolls thanks to wide straps.</p><p><em>“And tell me how it stays so incredibly seamless underneath a white top. Like I am so crazy impressed.” — real review from viral video</em></p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_UPbCRf": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it really work for larger breasts?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, it’s specifically designed to support larger breasts too.</p><p>Here’s how it works:</p><ul><li>Gel bands distribute weight evenly across your chest</li><li>Wide straps (4cm) reduce pressure on shoulders</li><li>Wide back band (8cm) provides support without digging in</li></ul><p>What customers with D-DD cups say:</p><ul><li>“First wireless bra that actually supports me”</li><li>“No more shoulder pain”</li><li>“Supports like an underwire but without the pain”</li></ul>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_dypXmn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it roll up during the day?",
            "answer": "<p>No, it stays in position all day.</p><p>Why other bras roll up:</p><ul><li>Band too tight</li><li>Fabric doesn’t grip properly</li><li>Wrong design</li></ul><p>Ours:</p><ul><li>Wide band that grips naturally</li><li>Elastic but not compressive fabric</li><li>Design tested to stay put 10+ hours</li></ul><p>Hundreds of customers confirm: “No more constant adjusting throughout the day.”</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_MJyWNV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I breastfeed with this on?",
            "answer": "<p>[CONFIRM FOR YOUR PRODUCT] This piece does not have a nursing opening. It is a shaping swimsuit, not a nursing piece.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_kzMKHY": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I machine-wash it? How does it hold up against chlorine How do I wash it?  and salt?",
            "answer": "<p>Machine wash or hand wash — both work fine.</p><p><strong>Washing:</strong></p><ul><li>Wash at 30°C (cold water)</li><li>Use delicate cycle if machine washing</li><li>Regular detergent is fine</li><li>NO bleach, NO fabric softener (damages the gel)</li></ul><p><strong>Drying:</strong></p><ul><li>Lay flat or hang to dry</li><li>NEVER use dryer (ruins the gel technology)</li><li>Avoid direct sunlight (colors fade)</li></ul><p><strong>Storage:</strong></p><ul><li>Store flat or hanging</li><li>Don’t fold the gel bands (they’ll deform)</li></ul><p><strong>Tip:</strong> Get 2-3 and rotate them during the week — they’ll last twice as long.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_9WGVt7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "If I don't like it, can I return it? How easy is it?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. You have [30] days from delivery to try it at home and return it if it is not right. Email <strong>info@nicshape.com</strong> and we will send you the return instructions. See our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Refund Policy</a> for the full conditions.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_g3GAGU": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will my order arrive?",
            "answer": "<p>Delivery takes [5-7] days. Shipping is tracked, and you receive the tracking link by email as soon as your order leaves the warehouse.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_TG7XW8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I don't like it?",
            "answer": "<p>You can return it within [30] days. Email <strong>info@nicshape.com</strong> and we will guide you through the return and refund.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        }
